{1}{Are you another constable, then? What are you doing to find that terrible man?}{A woman constable? What are you doing to find that terrible man?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{I'm no constable, ma'am, just an interested citizen.}{}{5}{}{10}{lf 0 0, lf1 1}
{9}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{lf0 1}
{10}{Are you some sort of degenerate, sir? There is a madman on the loose out there and you are "interested"? This is nothing to play at, good sir.}{Are you some sort of degenerate, madam? There is a madman on the loose out there and you are "interested"? This is nothing to play at, good woman.}{}{}{}{gf2256 1}
{11}{Degenerate? I'm not the prostitute, here.}{}{5}{}{20}{re-5}
{12}{I am simply offering my help to put an end to these murders.}{}{5}{gf2212 1}{30}{}
{13}{Perhaps I can help if I knew more about the murders.}{}{5}{gf2212 0}{30}{}
{20}{I am just as the gods made me, sir. I do what I need to, to survive.}{I am just as the gods made me, madam. I do what I need to, to survive.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{That is your affair. I am here for information on what you know.}{}{5}{}{30}{}
{30}{I can tell you what I've seen. It was the most horrible vision I ever hope to behold. That pale skinned, slight shadow of a man, kneeling over Emily...and the blood! It was a sight I shall never forget.}{I can tell you what I've seen. It was the most horrible vision I ever hope to behold. That pale skinned, slight shadow of a man, kneeling over Emily...and the blood! It was a sight I shall never forget.}{}{}{}{gf2219 1}
{31}{Start from the beginning, if you would.}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{40}{We were out, working, and Emily had forgotten something or other at her home. So I waited for her outside, but she never came out. When I went inside to look for her is when I saw him.}{We were out, working, and Emily had forgotten something or other at her home. So I waited for her outside, but she never came out. When I went inside to look for her is when I saw him.}{}{}{}{}
{41}{What did the man look like?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{50}{}
{42}{You didn't see him go into the house?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{50}{It was difficult to tell, really, all that blood...[she shivers.] As I said, he was a slight man, possibly an elf. He didn't appear to be possessing much physical power. He must 'ave cast some sort of magick on her, he did.}{It was difficult to tell, really, all that blood...[she shivers.] As I said, he was a slight man, possibly an elf. He didn't appear to be possessing much physical power. He must 'ave cast some sort of magick on her, he did.}{}{}{}{lf2 1}
{51}{You didn't see him go into the house?}{}{5}{}{60}{}
{60}{No, and there is really no way to enter the house that I couldn't see from where I was standing.}{No, and there is really no way to enter the house that I couldn't see from where I was standing.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{What did the man look like?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{80}{}
{62}{I see. Good day, madam.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{70}{Please kill the bastard that cut up Emily. He deserves to suffer as she did.}{Please kill the bastard that cut up Emily. He deserves to suffer as she did.}{}{}{}{}
{71}{I will try my best. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
